,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_19","text":"I didn't think you'd actually go through with opening the garden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_20","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_21","text":"Can I tell you something, Blossom?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_22","text":"The truth is, I always thought the garden was a place only for me and the flowers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_23","text":"A secret garden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_24","text":"A sanctuary for me and the flowers, and no one else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_25","text":"That's why I originally was against showing it to anyone else.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_26","text":"But I was only being selfish,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_27","text":"and because of that, no one was able to visit the garden, and people grew to care less and less about it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_28","text":"I think that's what led to all this in the first place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_29","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_30","text":"The reason I'm opening the garden to the public isn't just to give me time to let the Aurora Bloom grow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_secretgarden_05_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"flora","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_secretgarden_05_e_31","text":"I also want everyone to see that these flowers are worth something.","jump":null,"